<maintwp chngno="0" wpno="m0004-1-1680-TNG"><wpidinfo>
<maintlvl level="maintainer"/>
<title>MICROPHONE BOOM REMOVAL/INSTALLATION</title>
</wpidinfo><initial_setup>
<tools>
<tools-setup-item><name>SCREWDRIVER, CROSS-TIP</name><itemref><xref itemid="S0002_cross_tip_screw" wpid="s0002-1-1680-TNG"/></itemref></tools-setup-item>
</tools>
</initial_setup>
<maintsk><remove><proc>
<title>MICROPHONE BOOM REMOVAL</title>
<step1>
<para>Using a cross-tip screwdriver, remove swivel assembly screw <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="1"/>.</para></step1>
<step1 inschlvl="1">
<para>Remove the flat washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="3"/> from boom support washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="9"/>.</para></step1>
<step1>
<para>Remove special washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="5"/> from boom support washer.</para></step1>
<step1>
<para>Remove boom <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="8"/> and other grooved washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="4"/>.</para><step2>
<para>Remove microphone cord from clip attached to boom assembly.</para></step2><step2><specpara>
<warning>
<trim.para>Unplug microphone cord from communications jack to prevent electrical shock.</trim.para>
</warning>
<para>Remove thumbscrew from boom and remove microphone from boom.</para></specpara></step2></step1>
</proc></remove></maintsk>
<maintsk><install><proc>
<title>MICROPHONE BOOM INSTALLATION</title>
<step1>
<para>Using a cross-tip screwdriver, attach screw <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="6"/> to knurled knob <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="7"/>.</para></step1>
<step1>
<para>Attach the flat washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="3"/> to boom support washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="9"/>.</para></step1>
<step1 inschlvl="1">
<para>Using a cross-tip screwdriver, attach swivel assembly screw <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="1"/> and washer <callout assocfig="M00016_MS098897A" label="2"/>.</para></step1>
<step1>
<para>Plug microphone cord into communications jack on rear of helmet.  <figure id="M00016_MS098897A"><title>Boom and Microphone</title>
<graphic boardno="MS098897A"></graphic>
</figure></para></step1>
</proc></install></maintsk>
</maintwp>
